TITLE                       "Sequential Account File for OpenVMS"
IDENT                       31-MAY-2026 OpenVMS FDL Editor

SYSTEM
    SOURCE                  OpenVMS

FILE
    ALLOCATION              1000
    BEST_TRY_CONTIGUOUS     yes
    ORGANIZATION            SEQUENTIAL
    EXTENSION               100

SHARING
    GET                     yes
    PUT                     yes
    UPDATE                  yes
    
RECORD
    FORMAT                  FIXED
    SIZE                    100
